---
import TextLink from "../Links/TextLink.astro";
---

<section class="my-36 flex flex-col gap-0">
  <h1 class="text-lg font-medium text-light-600 dark:text-dark-0">
    Roland Tóth
  </h1>
  <p class="text-base font-normal text-light-500/80 dark:text-dark-200">
    /ˈrolɒnd toːt/
  </p>
</section>
<section class="mb-24 flex flex-col gap-3 text-light-500/80 dark:text-dark-200">
  <h2 class="text-lg text-light-600 dark:text-dark-0">Welcome!</h2>
  <p class="text-justify">
    Hi, I’m Roland, a software engineer with a degree from the Budapest
    University of Technology and Economics. I’ve worked on various projects,
    including an internship at <TextLink href="https://www.audi.hu/en/"
      >Audi</TextLink
    >, where I gained practical experience in software development.
  </p>
  <p>
    In my free time, I enjoy running and hiking — anything that gets me
    outdoors. Feel free to check out my website to know what I'm currently up to
    or get in touch through either <TextLink href="mailto:hi@rolandtoth.com"
      >e-mail</TextLink
    > or <TextLink href="https://x.com/rlndtth">X</TextLink>.
  </p>
</section>
